MethylDiver derives its baseline metric definitions and coordinate/pattern
conventions from the CK-AML epidec 0.1.0 implementation.

An unchanged copy of the original scalar metric module is retained at
tests/fixtures/legacy_metrics.py for differential regression testing.
Its SHA-256 is recorded in tests/fixtures/baseline.json.

